@startuml
title A witness carries a committed entry across
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

participant "A (data, leader)" as A
participant "W (witness)" as W
participant "B (data)" as B

A -> W: AppendEntries(entry 7)
W --> A: ok
note over A: entry 7 committed by A and W\nB has not received it yet
A ->x B: AppendEntries(entry 7)

destroy A
note over A: A fails

B -> W: PreVote(lastLogIndex=6)
W --> B: refused: W's log is newer (§5.4.1)
note over B: B cannot win

note over W: election timeout of a witness:\nthree times that of a data node
W -> B: PreVote / RequestVote(lastLogIndex=7)
B --> W: granted
note over W: W leads.\nIt refuses every client request.

W -> B: AppendEntries(entry 7, no-op 8)
B --> W: ok, matchIndex = 8
note over W: B holds the whole log
W -> B: TimeoutNow
B -> W: RequestVote(transfer)
W --> B: granted
note over B: B leads and serves clients.\nEntry 7 was never lost.

@enduml
